CYN黑鸮落在树枝上，边跳边叫，叫声急切，好似气急败坏，没一会便振翅飞向了山中。NOR]],["id"]=[[rlt_22qjzhuatx1text03]]},["rlt_22qjzhuatx1text04"]={["arg1"]=[[文本输出]],["arg2"]=[[CYN你每每要离开，黑鸮便向你扑去拦路，待你停下便落在树枝上盯着你，好似在逗弄你。NOR]],["id"]=[[rlt_22qjzhuatx1text04]]},["rlt_22qjzhuatx1text05"]={["arg1"]=[[文本输出]],["arg2"]=[[CYN特性【鹰击】、【鹰击-身】、【鹰击-浅谙】已解锁。NOR]],["id"]=[[rlt_22qjzhuatx1text05]]},["rlt_22qjzhuatx1textout01"]={["arg1"]=[[弹出文本]],["arg2"]=[[特性【鹰击】、【鹰击-身】、【鹰击-浅谙】已解锁]],["id"]=[[rlt_22qjzhuatx1textout01]]},["rlt_22qjzhuatx2add01"]={["arg1"]=[[添加人物]],["arg2"]=[[22qjzhuatx2npc01]],["id"]=[[rlt_22qjzhuatx2add01]]},["rlt_22qjzhuatx2add02"]={["arg1"]=[[添加人物]],["arg2"]=[[22qjzhuatxitem04]],["id"]=[[rlt_22qjzhuatx2add02]]},["rlt_22qjzhuatx2bj02"]={["arg1"]=[[可传承玩家标记设置]],["arg2"]=[[qj_zhuatx2]],["arg3"]=1,["id"]=[[rlt_22qjzhuatx2bj02]]},["rlt_22qjzhuatx2bj03"]={["arg1"]=[[更新拳脚系统标记]],["arg2"]=[[3003txkq]],["arg4"]=[[22qjzhuatx2text05;22qjzhuatx2text06;22qjzhuatx2textout01;22qjzhuatx2bj02;delete]],["id"]=[[rlt_22qjzhuatx2bj03]]},["rlt_22qjzhuatx2change01"]={["arg1"]=[[换人]],["arg2"]=[[22qjzhuatx2npc01]],["arg3"]=[[22qjzhuatx2npc02]],["id"]=[[rlt_22qjzhuatx2change01]]},["rlt_22qjzhuatx2text01"]={["arg1"]=[[文本输出]],["arg2"]=[[CYN你方走进此地，便见一抹黄色蹿到你跟前，苗清紧随其后。NOR
